	(text "OpenLED WROOM host board - github.com/amsterisk/openled-wroom\n5 V in is logic power only (~300 mA peak). LED strips get their power directly from the PSU(s)\nwith injection every ~150-200 LEDs; J2-J5 (JST XH, 1 = data, 2 = GND) carry data + a GND reference per output.\nWLED: outputs 1-4 = GPIO16, 17, 18, 19; button = GPIO0 (SW1, also boot mode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
